<http://data.silknow.org/object/3d99d3d6-35ac-3904-9f68-a44d20565788/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A linen coif embroidered with black silk in speckling stitch and outline stitch, and silver-gilt thread in plaited braid and detached buttonhole stitch, with silver-gilt spangles.    The pattern consists of silver-gilt scrolling stems bearing blackwork roses, foxglove, insects and birds. The coif is unlined, with a casing at the bottom.  The front is edged with bobbin lace in silver-gilt thread and spangles.  The seam at the top appears to have been unpicked and re-sewn at a later date."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3d99d3d6-35ac-3904-9f68-a44d20565788> .

<http://data.silknow.org/image/b1da0a60-4c27-361e-bd21-3b25f53d0f4d>
